# The cheatsheet clips a long description short of the command id, which
# keeps its whole width (NvChad's cheatsheet truncates inside the
# column). mnml painted the id over the description's tail:
# "…every workspace sectionview.toggle_hidde".
command editor.use_vim
key space
key c
key h
expect screen contains "view.toggle_hidden_all"
expect screen lacks "sectionview."
